#sortorder:1
#showas:酒吧斗殴旁观者
A rather crazy scenario. There's a single faction and two AIs, and both are set to difficulty 7.
This difficulty is good for someone who is a bit more experienced at AI War 2.

This is on the "wheel" map type, with 70 planets. Bar Fighter AI type in both cases, which are extremely aggressive when defending their planets.
Your starting fleet is set to "Cloaked," which is all about being sneaky, bypassing AI forces and hitting vital targets, as well as shooting from safety.

The Dark Spire have Vengeance Generators on a few planets, which absorb energy from units that die there, and uses it to warp in ships to cause havoc; if left unchecked, it can create new Generators, and be a very large problem.

Compared to the simpler scenario, this is pretty messy. As the AIs wage their Civil War, the Dark Spire can be triggered en masse, and can definitely cause a lot of chaos.

This is not a sane scenario, and is more for fun rather than something serious.